OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over deadly bus stop
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was found guilty of killing a
OL,7,Fpassenger he assaulted at a bus stop
OL,8,Fhas been jailed.
OL,10,FDarren Bakewell punched and pushed
OL,11,FChristopher Pearson, 78, following an
OL,12,Fexchange in Long Street, Wigston, on 15
OL,13,FOctober 2022, causing him to fall
OL,14,Fbackwards on to a low brick wall and
OL,15,Fmetal railings.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Police said Pearson died
OL,18,Fin hospital 10 days later after
OL,19,Fsuffering complications arising from
OL,20,Fhis injuries from the assault.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
