OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over deadly bus stop
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FBakewell, 62, of Bentinghouse Gardens
OL,7,Fin Leicester, was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmanslaughter in September, and was
OL,9,Fjailed for two years and nine months at
OL,10,FNorthampton Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
